<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HTMLove | Spread Kindness</title>
</head>

<body>

    <!-- HEADER AND NAVIGATION -->
    <header>

    <img src="IMG_0546.webp"
         alt="HTMLove Official Logo"
         width="350">

    <h1>HTMLove</h1>
    <h3>Coding with Heart</h3>

    <p>
        A digital platform that spreads kindness and love
        through simple good deeds.
    </p>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a> |
        <a href="#tasks">Kindness Tasks</a> |
        <a href="#challenge">Daily Challenge</a> |
        <a href="#wall">Kindness Wall</a> |
        <a href="#progress">My Progress</a> |
        <a href="#about">About Us</a> |
        <a href="#contact">Contact Us</a>
    </nav>

</header>

<hr>

    <!-- HOME PAGE -->
    <main>

        <section id="home">
            <h2>Welcome to HTMLove! ♡</h2>

            <h3>Small Acts. Big Changes.</h3>

            <p>
                Welcome to HTMLove, a digital space where kindness begins
                with simple actions. Discover meaningful challenges,
                share your good deeds, and inspire others to make the
                world a better place.
            </p>

            <p>
                Remember: You don't need to do something extraordinary
                to make someone's day special.
            </p>

            <a href="#tasks">Start Your Kindness Journey</a>

            <hr>

            <h3>What Can You Do Here?</h3>

            <ul>
                <li>Discover daily acts of kindness.</li>
                <li>Complete meaningful challenges.</li>
                <li>Share your good deeds with others.</li>
                <li>Track your kindness journey.</li>
                <li>Spread positivity and inspiration.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- KINDNESS TASKS -->
        <section id="tasks">
            <h2>♡ Kindness Tasks</h2>

            <p>
                Every good deed starts with a simple action.
                Choose a task and make someone's day better!
            </p>

            <h3>Kindness Checklist</h3>

            <form>
                <fieldset>
                    <legend>Everyday Kindness</legend>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task1">
                    <label for="task1">Give someone a sincere compliment.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task2">
                    <label for="task2">Help someone carry their belongings.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task3">
                    <label for="task3">Say thank you to someone.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task4">
                    <label for="task4">Smile at someone who needs encouragement.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task5">
                    <label for="task5">Check on a friend or family member.</label>
                </fieldset>

                <br>

                <fieldset>
                    <legend>Community Kindness</legend>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task6">
                    <label for="task6">Donate clothes or unused belongings.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task7">
                    <label for="task7">Help clean your surroundings.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task8">
                    <label for="task8">Share food with someone in need.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task9">
                    <label for="task9">Volunteer in a community activity.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task10">
                    <label for="task10">Help an elderly person.</label>
                </fieldset>

                <br>

                <fieldset>
                    <legend>Acts of Love</legend>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task11">
                    <label for="task11">Express gratitude to your parents.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task12">
                    <label for="task12">Spend quality time with someone.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task13">
                    <label for="task13">Forgive someone who hurt you.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task14">
                    <label for="task14">Listen to someone without judging.</label>
                    <br>

                    <input type="checkbox" id="task15">
                    <label for="task15">Encourage someone to pursue their dreams.</label>
                </fieldset>
            </form>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- DAILY CHALLENGE -->
        <section id="challenge">
            <h2>♡ Daily Kindness Challenge</h2>

            <p>Today's challenge is:</p>

            <h3>Make Someone Smile!</h3>

            <p>
                Find someone who might be having a difficult day.
                Give them a compliment, offer encouragement, or simply
                let them know that they are appreciated.
            </p>

            <blockquote>
                "No act of kindness, no matter how small, is ever wasted."
                <br>
                — Aesop
            </blockquote>

            <p>
                <strong>Your mission:</strong>
                Complete this challenge and inspire someone else to do
                the same!
            </p>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- KINDNESS WALL -->
        <section id="wall">
            <h2>♡ The Kindness Wall</h2>

            <p>
                A place where good deeds are celebrated and positive
                experiences are shared.
            </p>

            <h3>Stories of Kindness</h3>

            <article>
                <h4>Helping a Classmate</h4>
                <p>
                    "I helped my classmate understand our lesson.
                    It felt good knowing that I was able to help
                    someone learn."
                </p>
                <p><em>Shared by: Anonymous</em></p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h4>A Simple Act of Giving</h4>
                <p>
                    "I shared my lunch with someone who forgot to bring
                    theirs. It was a small thing, but it made both of
                    us happy."
                </p>
                <p><em>Shared by: Anonymous</em></p>
            </article>

            <article>
                <h4>Choosing to Listen</h4>
                <p>
                    "I listened to a friend who needed someone to talk
                    to. Sometimes, being present is already an act
                    of kindness."
                </p>
                <p><em>Shared by: Anonymous</em></p>
            </article>

            <hr>

            <h3>Share Your Good Deed!</h3>

            <form action="#" method="get">

                <label for="name">Your Name:</label>
                <br>
                <input type="text" id="name" name="name"
                       placeholder="Enter your name" required>

                <br><br>

                <label for="story">Your Kindness Story:</label>
                <br>
                <textarea id="story" name="story"
                          rows="5" cols="40"
                          placeholder="Share your good deed here..."
                          required></textarea>

                <br><br>

                <button type="submit">Share My Story</button>

            </form>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- MY PROGRESS -->
        <section id="progress">
            <h2>♡ My Kindness Journey</h2>

            <p>
                Every little action counts. Keep track of your
                completed kindness activities!
            </p>

            <h3>My Achievements</h3>

            <ul>
                <li>First Step: Complete your first kindness task.</li>
                <li>Kind Heart: Complete five kindness tasks.</li>
                <li>Kindness Champion: Complete ten kindness tasks.</li>
                <li>Spread the Love: Share your good deed.</li>
                <li>Inspiration: Encourage someone to do good.</li>
            </ul>

            <h3>My Personal Reflection</h3>

            <form>
                <label for="reflection">
                    What did you learn from performing an act of kindness?
                </label>
                <br>

                <textarea id="reflection" rows="5" cols="40"
                          placeholder="Write your reflection here...">
                </textarea>

                <br><br>

                <button type="reset">Clear Reflection</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- INSPIRATIONAL QUOTES -->
        <section id="inspiration">
            <h2>♡ Words of Inspiration</h2>

            <blockquote>
                "Be kind and compassionate to one another."
                <br>
                — Ephesians 4:32
            </blockquote>

            <blockquote>
                "Spread love everywhere you go."
                <br>
                — Mother Teresa
            </blockquote>

            <blockquote>
                "Kindness is a language which the deaf can hear
                and the blind can see."
                <br>
                — Mark Twain
            </blockquote>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- ABOUT US -->
        
<!-- ABOUT US -->
<section id="about">

    <h2>♡ About HTMLove</h2>

    <h3>Who We Are</h3>

    <p>
        HTMLove is a web-based platform designed to encourage
        individuals to practice kindness through simple,
        meaningful, and everyday actions.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Mission</h3>

    <p>
        To inspire people to make kindness a daily habit
        and create a positive impact in their communities.
    </p>

    <h3>Our Vision</h3>

    <p>
        To build a world where compassion, love, and generosity
        become part of everyone's everyday life.
    </p>

    <h3>Why HTMLove?</h3>

    <p>
        We believe that even the smallest acts of kindness
        can make a difference. Through technology, we aim to
        create a digital community that encourages people
        to spread love and positivity.
    </p>

    <hr>

    <h3>Meet the Creators</h3>

    <p>
        HTMLove was conceptualized and developed by:
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li><strong>Kendrick S. Jacob</strong></li>
        <li><strong>Kerby Cherub Purawan</strong></li>
    </ul>

    <p>
        We are first-year Bachelor of Science in Information
        Technology students from Divine Word College of Legazpi,
        an SVD school located in Legazpi City, Albay.
    </p>

    <p>
        Through this project, we aim to combine our passion
        for technology with our belief that simple acts of
        kindness can create meaningful changes in society.
    </p>

    <blockquote>
        "Coding with Heart, Spreading Kindness Everywhere."
    </blockquote>

</section>


        <!-- CONTACT US -->
        <section id="contact">
            <h2>♡ Contact Us</h2>

            <p>
                Have suggestions, questions, or feedback?
                We would love to hear from you!
            </p>

            <form action="#" method="get">

                <label for="contactName">Full Name:</label>
                <br>
                <input type="text" id="contactName"
                       name="contactName" required>

                <br><br>

                <label for="email">Email Address:</label>
                <br>
                <input type="email" id="email"
                       name="email" required>

                <br><br>

                <label for="message">Your Message:</label>
                <br>
                <textarea id="message" name="message"
                          rows="5" cols="40"
                          placeholder="Write your message..."
                          required></textarea>

                <br><br>

                <button type="submit">Send Message</button>

            </form>
        </section>

        <hr>

        <!-- FAQ -->
        <section id="faq">
            <h2>♡ Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

            <details>
                <summary>What is HTMLove?</summary>
                <p>
                    HTMLove is a digital platform that encourages
                    kindness through simple good deeds.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details>
                <summary>Who can participate?</summary>
                <p>
                    Anyone who wants to spread kindness and make
                    a positive difference can participate.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details>
                <summary>Do I need to spend money to participate?</summary>
                <p>
                    No! Many acts of kindness are completely free.
                    A smile, a compliment, or a helping hand can
                    already make someone's day.
                </p>
            </details>

            <details>
                <summary>How can I spread kindness?</summary>
                <p>
                    Start by completing the kindness tasks,
                    sharing your experiences, and inspiring others.
                </p>
            </details>
        </section>

    </main>

    <hr>

    <!-- FOOTER -->
    <footer>
        <h2>♡ HTMLove</h2>

        <p>
            Spreading kindness and love, one good deed at a time.
        </p>

        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a> |
            <a href="#tasks">Tasks</a> |
            <a href="#about">About Us</a> |
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>

        <p>
            &copy; 2026 HTMLove. All Rights Reserved.
        </p>

        <p><em>Choose kindness. Share love. Make a difference.</em></p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
